The source-level stmap35 wiring and mapper-mode changes appear consistent, but the tracked AutoEDA state/logging is not commit-ready. The iteration remains active and lacks the canonical version record required for a completed campaign step.

Review comment:

- [P2] Finalize the stmap35 campaign record — /Users/cunxiy/Documents/research/autoresearch-eda/abc-harness/.autoeda/runtime/campaign_state.json:9-11
  When the validated stmap35 iteration is committed, this active `evaluation-complete` state will leave `.autoeda` saying stmap35 is still in progress while the version log still ends at stmap34, so the harness cannot treat the iteration as completed/reproducible or safely advance to the next one. Finalize the state (clear `active_*`, set last-completed to 35) and add the canonical `version35 / stmap35` entry before committing.
